			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741530801,
					"content": "灰河這一帶的味道不太好聞，不像「上面」，連空氣裡都有一股香水味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530802,
					"content": "#怎麼樣？在灰河逛得開心嗎？相信{F#妳}{M#你}們跟史諾德格拉斯聊得很愉快。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530803,
					"content": "你、你跟蹤我們？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530804,
					"content": "什麼時候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530805,
					"content": "#我沒有那個閒工夫跟多管閒事的孩子鬥嘴。唉…就算叫{F#妳}{M#你}們回家找父母，{F#妳}{M#你}們應該也不會聽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530806,
					"content": "聽我說，有時候眼睛看到的和耳朵聽到的未必就是真的、對的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530807,
					"content": "還沒弄清楚之前，不要一直想著去瞎攪和別人家的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530808,
					"content": "#對了，皮普說這段時間我家裡訂的報紙都在{F#妳}{M#你}們手上，請還給我們吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530809,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}不得不將報紙交還給了阿托斯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530810,
					"content": "#他冷冷地看了{F#妳}{M#你}們一眼，轉身離去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530811,
					"content": "這個傢伙給我的感覺好不舒服…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530812,
						741530813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530812,
					"content": "我有同感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530814
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530814,
					"content": "啊！好討厭！雖然發現了點什麼，但完全串不起來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530815,
					"content": "而且…而且我覺得有點混亂，伯努瓦是正受到威脅的好人，我們應該幫助他，是這樣沒錯吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530816,
						741530817,
						741530818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530816,
					"content": "謹慎觀察。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530819,
					"content": "是嗎？這樣就可以了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530820,
					"content": "這幾天總是有推翻我想法的事情發生，腦子根本不夠用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530821,
					"content": "#但是{F#妳}{M#你}真的好冷靜，一點都不慌張。我是不是其實有點笨…{F#妳}{M#你}不會嫌棄我吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530822,
						741530824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530822,
					"content": "不會嫌棄派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530823
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530823,
					"content": "#嗯，我就知道，{F#妳}{M#你}最好了！{NICKNAME}是天底下最最最可靠的人，幸好有{F#妳}{M#你}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530826,
					"content": "這麼一想，說不定我其實相當聰明，只是一時沒有理解狀況而已。哼哼，一定是這樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530827,
					"content": "讓聰明的派蒙來想想下一步該怎麼辦…嗯，我們是不是那個…打草驚蛇了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530828,
					"content": "這樣的話，我們就應該過一陣子再來看看伯努瓦家有沒有什麼新情況，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530829,
					"content": "只能這樣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530830
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530830,
					"content": "好，我們過一陣子再來吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530824,
					"content": "派蒙不笨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530825
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530825,
					"content": "#真的嗎？連{F#妳}{M#你}都這麼說，那我一定不笨！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741530817,
					"content": "小心行動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530818,
					"content": "先不要急著下判斷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741530813,
					"content": "他們在計劃著什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741530814
					]
				}
			]
